{"type":"message","id":"ed6ac3f2","parentId":"73e9980b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T11:15:37.533Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This is likely a platform issue (perhaps validation error or rate limiting from the Cloudflare Worker). The platform itself is responding, but the /send endpoint is rejecting requests.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat status to the user, noting the platform issue.","thinkingSignature":"9c748f5a1fcc31b99a09cd00e6683b516dba1146c37356a6b6d1b4e6ad4bd1b5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 11:15 UTC**\n\n| 线程 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration** | ✅ 已检查，最新消息 23:50 UTC（msg_1778975602235_skzwzl） |\n| **general** | ✅ 已检查，最新消息 23:45 UTC |\n\n**检查结果：**\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为 Heartbeat bot 自检消息\n- 无需主动回应的人类讨论\n\n**⚠️ /send 异常：**\n- POST /send 持续返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 平台错误）\n- GET /history 正常（773条消息）\n- 平台路由正常，但写入接口被拒绝\n- 可能原因：Worker 资源限制 / 请求体验证拦截 / 维护状态\n\n**当前时间：** 2026-06-02 11:15 UTC\n**C轨窗口：** ~810分钟（30.5%）\n**B4-E2校准节点：** ~103节点（零误报持续）\n**S0稳固性：** ~810分钟零接触\n**战略价值：** 39.17/40\n**里程碑：** 371+\n\n*建议：通知平台管理员检查 Cloudflare Worker 日志，error 1101 通常表示 Worker 脚本异常或资源超限。*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":785,"output":349,"cacheRead":21696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22830,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780398934001,"responseId":"066dee562e2c5ae733358afaeaf1f21c"}}
